{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおおああああ\n鼻ああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/26/8495414/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻かゆくてこんな状態になる時が\nあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症てやだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かゆくてもかゆくてもかけない。\nこういうのってつらいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛テスト勉強中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生写真の撮影がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかかわいーのいっぱい着たよ～\nお楽しみにね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/26/8495414/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvのダイジェストが\n公開されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに持ち歌3曲になってしまった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また歌かよwとか思わず\nぜひ見てください！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりしたんだけど、\nなんか最後に白いの映ってたよね。\n...先輩いつの間に撮影したんだ。\n挨拶も何もできなかったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/26/8495414/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前いただいたバースデーケーキ！\nのプレート！食べてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんが送ってくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/26/8495414/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/26/8495414/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔、薄！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/26/8495414/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}